        "PMC11642357::web::004::1_introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding boron or silicon to a phosphorus-containing high-entropy or compositionally complex alloy will improve the thermal stability of its amorphous state.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC11642357::web::004::1_introduction",
        "PMC12278108::web::039::conclusion"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Phosphorus-containing high-entropy or compositionally complex alloys may initially be crystalline or partially amorphous.",
